{%- comment -%}
  CRO-12526 (v2) — New footer (Figma 38:983 desktop / 276:1171 mobile).
  Client request 2026-08-04: replaces the native footer on this template —
  sections/footer-custom.liquid (#shopify-section-footer-custom) is hidden
  via cro-12526-v2-pdp.css, which only loads on the cro-12526-v2 template,
  so every other page keeps the original footer. Control files untouched.

  Three link columns are "link" blocks assigned to a column; on mobile each
  column collapses into an accordion (chevron toggle, closed by default).
  Link set + destinations supplied by the client 2026-08-05 (all 15 verified
  live, incl. the odd singular /pages/terms-and-condition — plural 404s).
{%- endcomment -%}

{{ 'cro-12526-v2-pdp.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

